      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This is an annotated bibliography of selected references on stents. It includes 90 annotated references and 6 others that were not annotated. It has been structured to include pertinent details about each citation, including the site at which the device was used (coronary or peripheral), the type of article in which the research was reported (clinical paper, case report, abstract, review, editorial), the number of subjects and lesions treated, the design of the study (case study, single group, group comparison, or randomized trial), acute and late results, and comments about the study and its findings."},
